{"title": "沙发上的哲学家", "index": 19, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<p class=\"calibre_9\" id=\"filepos211307\"><span class=\"calibre1\">第八章</span></p><blockquote class=\"calibre_17\"><blockquote class=\"calibre_18\">去爱，去思考，去交流，试着每天都让自己更好一点儿。</blockquote></blockquote><div class=\"mbp_pagebreak\" id=\"calibre_pb_18\"></div>\n</body>"}]}